  "criteria": [
    {
      "id": "T-001",
      "family": "T",
      "statement": "界面源码的样式里不出现字面色值（hex / rgb() / hsl()），颜色一律从 token 取",
      "check": "static",
      "evidence": "file-line",
      "severity": "blocker",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "all"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/design/ui-v1/shared/设计token字典.md",
        "anchor": "1. 本文件**不出现**色值（`#rrggbb` / `rgb()` / 颜色名）、px / rem / em 数值。"
      },
      "humanReason": null,
      "tombstone": false
    },
    {
      "id": "T-002",
      "family": "T",
      "statement": "样式只有一个注入点：各模块只登记自己的 CSS，注入动作收敛到单一消费层（界面面的源文件里不再自己 `document.createElement('style')` 并挂到 head）",
      "check": "static",
      "evidence": "file-line",
      "severity": "major",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "all"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/design/ui-v1/shared/设计token字典.md",
        "anchor": "2. 线框里**不写 token**（线框只写结构与文案位），token 只出现在组件树与该屏第 9 节。"
      },
      "humanReason": null,
      "tombstone": false
    },
    {
      "id": "T-003",
      "family": "T",
      "statement": "断点不写字面值：`@media` 的宽窄屏分界只走 `--xs-size-breakpoint-wide`（1100px）的语义，样式里不出现 `min-width: 1100px` / `max-width: 700px` 这类字面 px",
      "check": "static",
      "evidence": "file-line",
      "severity": "major",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "all"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/design/ui-v1/shared/设计token字典.md",
        "anchor": "、px / rem / em 数值。"
      },
      "humanReason": null,
      "tombstone": false
    },
    {
      "id": "T-004",
      "family": "T",
      "statement": "颜色声明一律从 token 取：`color` / `background` / `border*` / `box-shadow` 的值是 `var(--…)`，或是允许的关键字（transparent / inherit / none / currentColor）",
      "check": "static",
      "evidence": "file-line",
      "severity": "major",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "all"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/design/ui-v1/shared/设计token字典.md",
        "anchor": "（`#rrggbb` / `rgb()` / 颜色名）"
      },
      "humanReason": null,
      "tombstone": false
    },
    {
      "id": "S-001",
      "family": "S",
      "statement": "每个界面面的源文件（同一文件内）既有「判空分支」（`kind === 'empty'` / `!x.length` / `x.length === 0` / 状态标记属性）又有一句中文空态说明；只有注释、只有一个字符串常量、或只有类型里的状态名，都算缺空态",
      "check": "static",
      "evidence": "file-line",
      "severity": "major",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "rendered"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/design/ui-v1/README.md",
        "anchor": "空态必须可执行"
      },
      "humanReason": null,
      "tombstone": false
    },
    {
      "id": "S-002",
      "family": "S",
      "statement": "每个界面面的源文件（同一文件内）既有「加载 / 进行中分支」（`loading` / `busy` / `running` / `pending` 出现在条件里，或状态标记属性点名 loading / pending）又有可见的加载证据（一句「正在…」或「…中」中文，或骨架屏标记 `xs-skeleton` / `data-xuanshu-skeleton`）；只有一个 loading 变量而没有可见证据，算缺加载态",
      "check": "static",
      "evidence": "file-line",
      "severity": "major",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "rendered"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/design/ui-v1/README.md",
        "anchor": "首屏 `loading` 用**卡级骨架**"
      },
      "humanReason": null,
      "tombstone": false
    },
    {
      "id": "S-003",
      "family": "S",
      "statement": "每个界面面的源文件（同一文件内）既有「错误分支」（`error` / `failed` / `failure` 出现在条件里，或错误状态标记属性）又有一句中文失败说明（「失败」「读不到」「打不开」「不可用」等）；错误行只把 `{error}` 变量原样直出、没有一句固定中文说法，算缺错误态",
      "check": "static",
      "evidence": "file-line",
      "severity": "major",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "rendered"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/design/ui-v1/README.md",
        "anchor": "`空态`、`加载态`、`错误态` 三种"
      },
      "humanReason": null,
      "tombstone": false
    },
    {
      "id": "L-001",
      "family": "L",
      "statement": "同一屏内的文字层级（标题 / 正文 / 次要 / 元信息）一眼可区分：相邻两级的字号或字重至少有一项不同，且同一级的元素在整屏里用同一档",
      "check": "human-only",
      "evidence": "screenshot",
      "severity": "major",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "rendered"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/design/ui-v1/assets/tokens/type-scale.md",
        "anchor": "字号分「语义档」，实现票在组件里**点名档位 token，不写死 px**"
      },
      "humanReason": "「一眼能不能分出层级」是审美判断：字号差、字重差都能被机器量（那已由 C-001/C-002 覆盖），但「这屏读起来是不是有层次」没有可复现的阈值。按 spec 003 §判据硬门槛，它只能由人看一次并签字，不许伪装成机器判据。",
      "tombstone": false
    },
    {
      "id": "D-001",
      "family": "D",
      "statement": "每个可点目标的可点区域不小于 44×44 CSS 像素（留白档：控件少而大，点得准）",
      "check": "browser",
      "evidence": "computed-style",
      "severity": "major",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "rendered"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/specs/003-ux-quality-line.md",
        "anchor": "点击目标 ≥44×44"
      },
      "humanReason": null,
      "tombstone": false
    },
    {
      "id": "D-002",
      "family": "D",
      "statement": "任一时刻一屏可见的主操作（`.xs-btn--primary`）不超过 1 个（留白档：一屏至多一个主操作；同一屏出现并列主操作即违反，同一屏在两个状态里各有一个不算并列）",
      "check": "browser",
      "evidence": "computed-style",
      "severity": "major",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "rendered"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/specs/003-ux-quality-line.md",
        "anchor": "单屏主操作 ≤1"
      },
      "humanReason": null,
      "tombstone": false
    },
    {
      "id": "C-001",
      "family": "C",
      "statement": "每个渲染出来的正文级文字元素（跳过 `aria-hidden`、控件标签，以及标成元信息的 tag / badge / 状态行 / 路径 / 计数）其计算字号 ≥ 16px；正文指 p / li / dd / td / 标题，或没有被标成元信息的文字——元信息走自己的小档，不参与这条",
      "check": "browser",
      "evidence": "computed-style",
      "severity": "major",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "rendered"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/specs/003-ux-quality-line.md",
        "anchor": "正文 ≥16px"
      },
      "humanReason": null,
      "tombstone": false
    },
    {
      "id": "C-002",
      "family": "C",
      "statement": "每个渲染出来的正文级文字元素其计算行高与字号之比 ≥ 1.5（`line-height: normal` 没有给出比值，按低于下限算）",
      "check": "browser",
      "evidence": "computed-style",
      "severity": "major",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "rendered"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/specs/003-ux-quality-line.md",
        "anchor": "行高 ≥1.5"
      },
      "humanReason": null,
      "tombstone": false
    },
    {
      "id": "C-003",
      "family": "C",
      "statement": "每个渲染出来的正文级文字元素与其有效背景的对比度达 WCAG AA：正文（字号 < 18.66px 或字重 < 700）≥ 4.5:1，大字（字号 ≥ 24px，或 ≥ 18.66px 且字重 ≥ 700）≥ 3:1",
      "check": "browser",
      "evidence": "computed-style",
      "severity": "major",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "rendered"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/specs/003-ux-quality-line.md",
        "anchor": "对比度达 WCAG AA"
      },
      "humanReason": null,
      "tombstone": false
    },
    {
      "id": "N-001",
      "family": "N",
      "statement": "同一个动作只有一个入口：同一动作名出现在两个及以上入口（侧栏行 / 面板 / 抽屉 / 输入框 dock / 命令）即红，并逐个列出是哪几个入口；置灰的入口不算入口",
      "check": "browser",
      "evidence": "computed-style",
      "severity": "major",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "rendered"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/specs/003-ux-quality-line.md",
        "anchor": "同一个动作只有一个入口"
      },
      "humanReason": null,
      "tombstone": false
    },
    {
      "id": "N-002",
      "family": "N",
      "statement": "关闭抽屉 / 面板后回到来处：关掉之后站的面必须等于打开它时站的面；落回首页（overview）即红",
      "check": "browser",
      "evidence": "computed-style",
      "severity": "major",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "rendered"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/specs/003-ux-quality-line.md",
        "anchor": "从抽屉 / 面板返回时回到我来的地方"
      },
      "humanReason": null,
      "tombstone": false
    },
    {
      "id": "N-003",
      "family": "N",
      "statement": "键盘能走完一条任务：本面里 Tab 顺序可达（至少两个骤停点）、每个焦点都有可见描边（`:focus-visible` 有 outline 或 box-shadow）、抽屉按 Esc 能关",
      "check": "browser",
      "evidence": "computed-style",
      "severity": "major",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "rendered"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/specs/003-ux-quality-line.md",
        "anchor": "键盘能走完一条完整任务（Tab 顺序、Esc 关抽屉、焦点可见）"
      },
      "humanReason": null,
      "tombstone": false
    },
    {
      "id": "X-001",
      "family": "X",
      "statement": "同一状态在所有界面面只用一套说法：空态只许「还没有…」「没有…」，加载态只许「正在…」「…中」，错误态只许「失败」「读不到」「打不开」「不可用」——「暂无」「空的」「加载中」「读取中」「请稍候」「出错」「错误」「异常」这类同义替换不许与它们并存；且错误行旁边必须有可执行的下一步（重试 / 换个 / 请在…），只有一句「失败了」不算",
      "check": "static",
      "evidence": "file-line",
      "severity": "major",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "rendered"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/design/ui-v1/README.md",
        "anchor": "在同一屏内复用，不新造同义词"
      },
      "humanReason": null,
      "tombstone": false
    }
  ],
